msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: BlazBlue Calamity Trigger Ukrainian Translation\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Language: uk\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=3; plural=(n%10==1 && n%100!=11 ? 0 : n%10>=2 && n%10<=4 && (n%100<10 || n%100>=20) ? 1 : 2);\n"

#. Key: ArcEveTG01_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: む、やはり通じんな。だが急な故障とも思えない。
#. JA:   結界か？やはりカグツチには何か不穏なものを感じるな。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG01_00"
msgid ""
"Hm. I can't get a hold of them. I don't think this is just a\n"
"malfunction. Is there a barrier of some sort? I feel\n"
"something threatening in Kagutsuchi."
msgstr ""
"Хм, звʼязку досі немає. На раптову несправність не схоже.\n"
"Барʼєр? У Каґуцучі таки відчувається щось лихе."

#. Key: ArcEveTG01_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: そこの方、
#. JA:   第七機関のテイガー殿とお見受けしますが、相違ありませんか？
msgctxt "ArcEveTG01_01"
msgid ""
"Excuse me!\n"
"I believe you are Sir Tager from Sector Seven, correct?"
msgstr ""
"Перепрошую. Якщо не помиляюся, ви пан Тейґер із\n"
"Сектора Сім?"

#. Key: ArcEveTG01_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: そうだが、何か。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG01_02"
msgid "Yes, I am. Can I help you?"
msgstr "Так. А що?"

#. Key: ArcEveTG01_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 現在ここ第十三階層都市「カグツチ」は統制機構の管理の下、
#. JA:   LvDの警戒警告が発令されています。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG01_03"
msgid ""
"Currently the 13th Hierarchical City, \"Kagutsuchi\", is\n"
"under control of the Library, and they have issued a Level\n"
"D warning."
msgstr ""
"Наразі тринадцяте ієрархічне місто Каґуцучі перебуває під\n"
"контролем Організації контролю, і тут оголошено тривогу\n"
"рівня D."

#. Key: ArcEveTG01_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 「他機関介入不可」を示しているのはご存知かと思いますが。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG01_04"
msgid ""
"I'm sure you know of the \"Inter-Organization Interference\n"
"Prevention Act\", right?"
msgstr ""
"Ви, певно, знаєте, що це означає: «втручання інших\n"
"організацій заборонено»."

#. Key: ArcEveTG01_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 無論。だがそういうわけにもいかなくてな。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG01_05"
msgid ""
"Of course, I do.\n"
"Unfortunately, I can't defer to you right now."
msgstr "Авжеж. Але обставини не дозволяють мені зважати на це."

#. Key: ArcEveTG01_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: ば、場合によっては武力行使も免れませんよ！
msgctxt "ArcEveTG01_06"
msgid ""
"I-In the worst case scenario, we may have to  use\n"
"military force!"
msgstr "Я-якщо доведеться, ми застосуємо силу!"

#. Key: ArcEveTG01_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 悪いが、第七機関は「図書館」の指示など受けない。
#. JA:   武力による解決がお望みならば、答えてやろう。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG01_07"
msgid ""
"Sorry, but Sector Seven does not accept any orders from\n"
"the Library. If you would like to use force to resolve this\n"
"issue, that is acceptable."
msgstr ""
"Вибач, але Сектор Сім не виконує наказів «Бібліотеки».\n"
"Якщо бажаєш розвʼязати це силою — я відповім тим\n"
"самим."

#. Key: ArcEveTG01_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 罪が、重く、なりますよ……うっ。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG01_08"
msgid "This is only...going to get you...into more trouble... Ugh..."
msgstr "Так ваша провина... лише... обтяжиться... Ух..."

#. Key: ArcEveTG01_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 見たところ実戦経験の浅い新米のようだったな。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG01_09"
msgid ""
"A novice with hardly any field experience...\n"
"Hmph."
msgstr ""
"Схоже, вона новобраниця, яка майже не має бойового\n"
"досвіду."

#. Key: ArcEveTG01_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 手加減はしたから大丈夫だとは思うが、
#. JA:   女子供と戦うのは気が引ける。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG01_10"
msgid ""
"I was trying to hold back a little, so she should be OK, but\n"
"this is why I don't like fighting women or children."
msgstr ""
"Я стримувався, тож із нею, гадаю, все буде гаразд. Та мені\n"
"не до душі битися з жінками й дітьми."

#. Key: ArcEveTG02_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 久しぶりだな――それにしても随分、変わったな。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG02_00"
msgid "Long time no see... You sure have changed a lot though."
msgstr "Давно не бачилися... Хоча змінився ти добряче."

#. Key: ArcEveTG02_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 　サマ　誰　　　の記憶に　該　し　い　　グヴヴ
msgctxt "ArcEveTG02_01"
msgid ""
"Who                   you? You don               my memorie    \n"
"Ggghrrk..."
msgstr "Т  хто? У моїй памʼяті      немає... Ґв-в-в..."

#. Key: ArcEveTG02_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: ライチが心配しているぞ、もちろんココノエもな。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG02_02"
msgid "Litchi is worried about you. Kokonoe as well, of course."
msgstr "Лічі непокоїться за тебе. І Коконое, звісно, теж."

#. Key: ArcEveTG02_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: ライチ　？　　ココ　　　　？　
msgctxt "ArcEveTG02_03"
msgid "Litchi   ? Koko        ?"
msgstr "Лічі...? Коко   ...?"

#. Key: ArcEveTG02_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: ココ　　、コ　ノエ　ココノエ　ココノエ　ああああ！！！
#. JA:   また　いつか　あいつが　が　またあいつ　ああ　キィヒヒヒ！！
msgctxt "ArcEveTG02_04"
msgid ""
"Koko     ...Ko    noe  Kokonoe  Kokonoe  ARRGGHHH!\n"
"      again  She might   might    Aagh  Keeheehee!"
msgstr ""
"Коко   ... Ко  ное... Коконое... Коконое... А-а-а-а!!! Зно у...\n"
"коли ь... вона...      знову вона... А-а... Кі-хі-хі!!"

#. Key: ArcEveTG02_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: そ　　、知って　　！　サマも知って　る　　　ぐおおおおお！！
msgctxt "ArcEveTG02_05"
msgid "That's        ... I                ! I know  ou too! Guooooh!"
msgstr "Це... я зна ! І т  бе знаю! Ґу-о-о-о!!"

#. Key: ArcEveTG02_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 貴様の事はライチに任せるつもりでいたが――
msgctxt "ArcEveTG02_06"
msgid "I was planning to leave you up to Litchi, but..."
msgstr "Я збирався доручити тебе Лічі, але..."

#. Key: ArcEveTG02_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: やはり見逃すわけにはいかんな。
#. JA:   すまんが、私は貴様のような奴を救う手段は一つしか知らん。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG02_07"
msgid ""
"...I'm afraid I just can't let you roam free.\n"
"And unfortunately, I only know one way to save a guy\n"
"like you."
msgstr ""
"Та все-таки не можу просто тебе відпустити. Вибач, але я\n"
"знаю лише один спосіб урятувати таких, як ти."

#. Key: ArcEveTG02_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: ぐあああああああ　　あ　　め――――
msgctxt "ArcEveTG02_08"
msgid "GUAAAAAAAARGH  DAAAMN HIIIM..."
msgstr "Ґу-а-а-а-а-а-а... припи и-и-и—"

#. Key: ArcEveTG02_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: ！？　　ま、待て！ぐ、止めをささねば。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG02_09"
msgid "W-Wait! Damn it! I have to stop him."
msgstr "С-стій! Кх, треба його добити."

#. Key: ArcEveTG03_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 貴公か、何をしに来た。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG03_00"
msgid "You... What do you want?"
msgstr "Ти... Навіщо прийшов?"

#. Key: ArcEveTG03_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: ハクメンよ、ココノエから貴様の回収命令を受けている、
#. JA:   悪いがすぐに機関に戻ってもらうぞ。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG03_01"
msgid ""
"Hakumen. Kokonoe has ordered me to retrieve you.\n"
"I'm sorry, but I'm going to have you return to the Sector."
msgstr ""
"Хакумене, Коконое наказала мені забрати тебе. Вибач, але\n"
"ти негайно повернешся зі мною до Сектора."

#. Key: ArcEveTG03_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 第一貴様はまだ存在定着が不安定だ、あまり身勝手な行動は慎め。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG03_02"
msgid ""
"Your existence establishment is still unstable.\n"
"You should refrain from wandering off."
msgstr ""
"До того ж твоє існування ще нестабільно закріплене.\n"
"Припини діяти на власний розсуд."

#. Key: ArcEveTG03_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 私が、貴公等の手に依り次元平面から現世に還ったのは事実。
#. JA:   だが、其れは貴公等の手段の壱つで有り、私が従う義理は無い。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG03_03"
msgid ""
"It is true that people such as yourself returned me to this\n"
"world from a parallel dimension. However, I have no\n"
"obligation to abide by your rules."
msgstr ""
"Це правда, що завдяки вам я повернувся з Міжпростору до\n"
"реального світу. Та це лише один із ваших засобів, і я не\n"
"зобовʼязаний вам коритися."

#. Key: ArcEveTG03_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 機関は従わせる気などないだろう。
#. JA:   貴様は一抹の計画の手段、材料として認識されているにすぎない。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG03_04"
msgid ""
"I don't think the Sector has any intention of making you\n"
"abide by them. You're only a small part of their plan.\n"
"You're no more than a tool."
msgstr ""
"Сектор і не збирається змушувати тебе коритися. Для\n"
"нього ти лише засіб, матеріал для певного плану."

#. Key: ArcEveTG03_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 貴様の回収には一年以上もの時間を費やした。
#. JA:   これ以上無駄な時間は食えないのだ。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG03_05"
msgid ""
"We've spent over a year retrieving you, and we can't\n"
"afford to waste any more time."
msgstr ""
"Ми витратили понад рік, щоб витягти тебе. Більше часу\n"
"марнувати не можна."

#. Key: ArcEveTG03_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 私には私の目的が在る、惟は私の存在意義だ、邪魔はさせぬ。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG03_06"
msgid ""
"I have my own goals. This is the meaning of my life.\n"
"I won't let you get in the way."
msgstr ""
"Я маю власну мету. Вона — сенс мого існування. Я не\n"
"дозволю тобі стати мені на заваді."

#. Key: ArcEveTG03_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 交渉決裂か。まだ不完全とはいえ貴様は六英雄の一人。
#. JA:   その力見せてもらおう。全力で行くぞ！
msgctxt "ArcEveTG03_07"
msgid ""
"I guess that's it for negotiations... You may be incomplete,\n"
"but you're still one of the Six Heroes. Let's see what\n"
"you've got. I won't hold back!"
msgstr ""
"Отже, переговори провалилися. Нехай ти ще не відновився\n"
"повністю, але ти один із Шістьох Героїв. Покажи мені свою\n"
"силу. Я битимуся на повну!"

#. Key: ArcEveTG03_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: ふっ……はははははは！鬼風情が、面白い！！！
msgctxt "ArcEveTG03_08"
msgid "Hah...hahahaha! You little devil! Interesting!"
msgstr "Ха... Ха-ха-ха-ха! Демоне, а ти цікавий!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveTG03_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 我は空、我は鋼、我は刃
#. JA:   我は一振りの剣にて全ての「罪」を刈り取り「悪」を滅する！！
msgctxt "ArcEveTG03_09"
msgid ""
"I am the white void. I am the cold steel. I am the just\n"
"sword. With blade in hand shall I reap the sins of this\n"
"world, and cleanse it in the fires of destruction."
msgstr ""
"Я — порожнеча. Я — сталь. Я — лезо... Я єдиним мечем\n"
"пожну всі «гріхи» та знищу «зло»!"

#. Key: ArcEveTG03_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 我が名は「ハクメン」、推して参る！
msgctxt "ArcEveTG03_10"
msgid "I am Hakumen. The end has come!"
msgstr "Імʼя мені Хакумен. До бою!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveTG03_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 侮って居た。流石だ。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG03_11"
msgid "I underestimated you. Very well."
msgstr "Я недооцінив тебе. Вражає."

#. Key: ArcEveTG03_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 理解したなら機関に戻るがいい、
#. JA:   私もすぐに戻るとココノエに伝えてくれ。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG03_12"
msgid ""
"If you understand, then I ask you to go back to the Sector.\n"
"And tell Kokonoe that I will return soon."
msgstr ""
"Якщо зрозумів, повертайся до Сектора. І передай Коконое,\n"
"що я теж невдовзі повернуся."

#. Key: ArcEveTG03_13
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: ふっ、戻れるのならな――
msgctxt "ArcEveTG03_13"
msgid "Heh. If I can return..."
msgstr "Хм. Якщо зможеш повернутися..."

#. Key: ArcEveTG04_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 何事だ、何が起きている？
msgctxt "ArcEveTG04_00"
msgid "What's wrong? What's going on?"
msgstr "Що це? Що відбувається?"

#. Key: ArcEveTG04_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 起動・起動・起動・起動・認識……
msgctxt "ArcEveTG04_01"
msgid "Loading...loading...loading...loading... Complete..."
msgstr "Запуск. Запуск. Запуск. Запуск. Ідентифіковано..."

#. Key: ArcEveTG04_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: なんだ、この威圧感は。この少女、いったい何者だ？
msgctxt "ArcEveTG04_02"
msgid "What the hell? What's this pressure? Who is this girl?"
msgstr "Що за тиск? Хто ця дівчина?"

#. Key: ArcEveTG04_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: この感覚、覚えがあるぞ。
#. JA:   あれは確かイカルガの――くそっ、思い出せん！
msgctxt "ArcEveTG04_03"
msgid ""
"I know this feeling...\n"
"I think Ikaruga's... Damn it, I can't remember!"
msgstr ""
"Я вже відчував щось подібне. Здається, в Ікарузі... Чорт, не\n"
"можу згадати!"

#. Key: ArcEveTG04_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 対象・認識・自律モード・起動
msgctxt "ArcEveTG04_04"
msgid "Target recognized. Auto-mode: activated."
msgstr "Ціль ідентифіковано. Автономний режим активовано."

#. Key: ArcEveTG04_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 近頃の少女は好戦的だな。
#. JA:   すまんココノエ、帰還が遅くなりそうだ。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG04_05"
msgid ""
"Girls these days are so belligerent.\n"
"Sorry, Kokonoe, I'll be running late."
msgstr ""
"Останнім часом дівчата аж надто войовничі. Вибач,\n"
"Коконое, схоже, я затримаюся."

#. Key: ArcEveTG04_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 対象・認識・障害・認識・排除・容認……対象を障害と認識
msgctxt "ArcEveTG04_06"
msgid ""
"Scanning complete. IFF determined. Processing...\n"
"Subject determined to be hostile."
msgstr ""
"Ціль ідентифіковано. Перешкоду ідентифіковано. Усунення\n"
"схвалено... Ціль визначено як перешкоду."

#. Key: ArcEveTG04_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 対象の殲滅を開始します
msgctxt "ArcEveTG04_07"
msgid "Begin termination."
msgstr "Розпочинаю знищення цілі."

#. Key: ArcEveTG04_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 何っ、時空が歪むだと！？
msgctxt "ArcEveTG04_08"
msgid "What? A time-space warp!?"
msgstr "Що?! Викривлення простору-часу?!"

#. Key: ArcEveTG05_00_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: あらテイガー、久しぶり。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG05_00_0"
msgid "Oh, Tager. Long time no see."
msgstr "О, Тейґере. Давно не бачилися."

#. Key: ArcEveTG05_00_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 部署は近いはずなのに、なかなか顔をあわせる機会がないわね。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG05_00_1"
msgid "Our departments are close, but I never see you around."
msgstr ""
"Хоч наші відділи й мають бути поруч, ми майже не\n"
"бачимося."

#. Key: ArcEveTG05_01_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: うむ、歓談したいところだが、これからココノエに用があってな。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG05_01_0"
msgid "Yeah. I'd love to sit here and chat, but I need to talk to Kokonoe."
msgstr ""
"Так. Я б залюбки поговорив, але зараз маю справу до\n"
"Коконое."

#. Key: ArcEveTG05_01_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 「すぐ来い、でなければ殺す」、だそうだ。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG05_01_1"
msgid "I think she's gonna kill me if I don't get there soon."
msgstr "«Приходь негайно, або вбʼю», — так вона сказала."

#. Key: ArcEveTG05_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: ……もしかしたらあの件？
msgctxt "ArcEveTG05_02"
msgid "...Is it about that case?"
msgstr "...Часом не через ту справу?"

#. Key: ArcEveTG05_03_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: うむ、時空平面、いや虚数空間だったか？
msgctxt "ArcEveTG05_03_0"
msgid "Yeah. The parallel space-time...no...was it the complex space?"
msgstr ""
"Так. Площина простору-часу... ні, простір уявних чисел,\n"
"здається?"

#. Key: ArcEveTG05_03_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: なんでも、そこに面白いものを発見したから回収を手伝えだとか。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG05_03_1"
msgid "Anyway, she found some interesting stuff and wanted help with it."
msgstr ""
"Каже, знайшла там щось цікаве й хоче, щоб я допоміг це\n"
"витягти."

#. Key: ArcEveTG05_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: まったく、おかげで星の裏側から帰って来ることになったぞ。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG05_04"
msgid "I had to go halfway around the damn world."
msgstr ""
"От же ж... Через це мені довелося повертатися з іншого\n"
"кінця планети."

#. Key: ArcEveTG05_05_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 常々人使いの荒い奴だとは思っていたが
msgctxt "ArcEveTG05_05_0"
msgid "I always knew she was a bit of a slave driver, but..."
msgstr "Я завжди знав, що вона нещадно ганяє підлеглих, але..."

#. Key: ArcEveTG05_05_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 近所の使いを頼むように国家単位の問題を任されては適わない。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG05_05_1"
msgid "...she asks me to do state-level tasks like they're minor errands."
msgstr ""
"коли доручають проблеми державного масштабу так, наче\n"
"просять виконати дрібне доручення, — це вже занадто."

#. Key: ArcEveTG05_06_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 数十年も続いた内戦も終息に向かってるとはいえ
msgctxt "ArcEveTG05_06_0"
msgid "Just when we thought this civil war was coming to an end,"
msgstr ""
"Хоч громадянська війна, яка тривала десятки років, і\n"
"наближається до завершення..."

#. Key: ArcEveTG05_06_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 安穏とはできないしな。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG05_06_1"
msgid "it seems like peace is still far off."
msgstr "розслаблятися ще зарано."

#. Key: ArcEveTG05_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: ふふ、テイガーに愚痴をいわせるなんて、さすがは我が師ね。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG05_07"
msgid "Hahaha, making even Tager complain...that's our professor."
msgstr ""
"Хи-хи. Навіть Тейґера змусила скаржитися — оце так моя\n"
"наставниця."

#. Key: ArcEveTG05_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: ん？ああ、すまん。今のは忘れてくれ。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG05_08"
msgid "Huh? Oh...sorry. Forget about what I just said."
msgstr "Гм? А, вибач. Забудь, що я щойно сказав."

#. Key: ArcEveTG05_09_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: で、例の件の事なんだが本当なのか？
msgctxt "ArcEveTG05_09_0"
msgid "But anyway, about that case. Is it really true?"
msgstr "То що там із тією справою? Це дійсно правда?"

#. Key: ArcEveTG05_09_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 報告書に書いてあったとはいえ未だ信じられないのだが。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG05_09_1"
msgid "I've read the reports...I still don't believe it."
msgstr "Я читав звіт, але досі не можу повірити."

#. Key: ArcEveTG05_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: ええ、博士の見解によると間違いないらしいわ。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG05_10"
msgid "In the professor's opinion, there's no doubt about it."
msgstr "Так. За висновком професорки, жодних сумнівів немає."

#. Key: ArcEveTG05_11_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: でも、あの空間で数十年もの間生きているなんて
msgctxt "ArcEveTG05_11_0"
msgid "But for someone to survive there for decades..."
msgstr "Але прожити в тому просторі кілька десятиліть..."

#. Key: ArcEveTG05_11_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 常識的に考えたら不可能としか思えないのだけど。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG05_11_1"
msgid "Logically, that's completely impossible."
msgstr "Як не крути, це здається неможливим."

#. Key: ArcEveTG05_12_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: まさかそんな所にいたとはな
msgctxt "ArcEveTG05_12_0"
msgid "Who would have thought he was in a place like that...?"
msgstr "Хто б міг подумати, що він був у такому місці..."

#. Key: ArcEveTG05_12_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTG_ArcEveTG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Tager
#. JA: 六英雄の一人「ハクメン」よ……。
msgctxt "ArcEveTG05_12_1"
msgid "Hakumen...one of the Six Heroes..."
msgstr "Хакумен — один із Шістьох Героїв..."
